<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
 &nbsp;<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care regarding your disrupted journey from {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
While safety is our number one priority, I understand how inconvenient the delay must have been for you and would like to apologise for any impact this had on your plans.<br />
<br />
We know the importance of great communication in situations like this, so I’m sorry to hear that our airport team didn’t manage the -delay/the rebooking/the booking of accommodation and transfers- as well as expected.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If the delay was within QF’s control, use: -</strong></em><br />
<br />
If you’ve paid for accommodation and meals out of pocket, we’ll reimburse you up to a total of $200 AUD per room for accommodation and $50 AUD per person for meals, transfers, or incidentals.<br />
<br />
For direct reimbursement, please fill out the Customer Care Payment Form and attach it to your reply email with any supporting receipts. For further information, please refer to our Compensation and Refunds page.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-If the customer is requesting compensation and not entitled, add: -</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>We're here to help</strong><br />
<br />
While the delay was outside our control and we’re unable to reimburse you for unexpected expenses such as accommodation, your travel insurance policy may cover these situations.<br />
<br />
Please tell us if you’d like us to provide you with an insurance letter to help with any claim.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team for review, and I hope that you have a better experience next time you travel with us.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
</html>